        "id": "e06e9ef7e85e5c21",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "PowerFlowState",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "Reads Power Flow State from registers:\n- 690: Battery power (S16, 1W)\n- 725+790: Grid total power (S32, 1W)\n- 753+759: Load total power (S32, 1W)\n- 767+771: Generator total power (S32, 1W)\n- 772-775: PV1-4 input power (1W)\n\nTriggers:\n1. Periodic: Every 5 minutes\n2. RPC: getPowerFlowState"
    },
